{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/speculative-decoding/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"acceptance-rate-tuning","title":"接受率与加速比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/speculative-decoding/practice/acceptance-rate-tuning","wordCount":1238,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"serving-batching-spec","title":"批服务下的推测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/speculative-decoding/practice/serving-batching-spec","wordCount":1426,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"speculative-in-practice","title":"落地与选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/speculative-decoding/practice/speculative-in-practice","wordCount":1229,"readingTime":5}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"实践\">实践</h1><p>前三章把推测解码讲透了：为什么有用、草稿从哪来、怎么把草稿做得又快又准。但真要在一套服务上按下「开启推测」的开关，会立刻撞上一堆论文里轻描淡写、生产里要命的问题——接受率到底换得了多少加速？并发一上来它怎么反而变慢了？vLLM、SGLang、TensorRT-LLM 该选哪个、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 调几、什么负载根本不该开？本章把镜头从算法切到部署，回答「在真实负载下怎么用对」。</p>\n<p>第一篇「接受率与加速比」建立定量直觉：把接受率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>、验证窗口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span>、草稿与目标的成本比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 串成一个加速比公式，让你能估算「我这个配置理论上能快多少」，并据此调 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span>、判断某个草稿源值不值。这是本章的「计算器」。</p>\n<p>第二篇「批服务下的推测」处理最反直觉、也最容易让人翻车的一点：推测解码在 batch=1 时大赚，但随着并发上升，GPU 从访存受限滑向计算受限，那块本来闲置、被推测「白嫖」的算力没了，推测从「赚」变成「赔」。它讲清这个 crossover 为什么发生、出现在哪、以及连续批处理、chunked prefill 等服务机制与推测的兼容性约束。</p>\n<p>第三篇「落地与选型」给出工程决策树：哪种负载该开推测、开了用哪种草稿源、在主流框架间怎么选、上线后看哪些指标。它把前面所有结论收敛成一张「该不该用、用什么、怎么调」的实操地图。</p>\n<p>三篇的逻辑是：先会算账（接受率→加速比），再懂账会随并发翻转（批服务），最后据此做端到端选型决策。读完本章，配合前三章的原理，你应当能独立地为一套真实服务决定推测解码的全部配置，并预判它会不会反而拖慢你。本章大量涉及与通用服务系统的交互，但只在「与推测相关」的边界上展开；完整的服务系统知识属于 <a href=\"../../llm-serving-inference-systems/\">LLM 服务推理系统</a>。</p>\n"}